# Contact form delivery (https://web3forms.com)
# 1. Enter hello@merakief.com on web3forms.com and click "Create Access Key".
# 2. The key is emailed to that address. Copy it into a file named .env.local:
#      VITE_WEB3FORMS_KEY=your-access-key-here
# 3. Restart `npm run dev`. When deploying, add the same variable in your host's
#    environment settings (Vercel / Netlify / etc.) and redeploy.
VITE_WEB3FORMS_KEY=
